//   Total Sales            346,272,113.50
//   Total Profit           130,244,001.78
//   Total Quantity         151,884
//   Total Orders           12,180
//   Profit Margin %        37.61 %
//   Average Order Value    28,429.57
//   Sales by year          2014 78.44M · 2015 76.48M · 2016 78.41M
//                          2017 80.44M · 2018 32.51M (data ends 25-May-2018)
//   YoY %                  2015 -2.49% · 2016 +2.52% · 2017 +2.59% · 2018 -59.59%*
//   Brand contribution     Fullerton 50.00% · Accord 27.89% · Cixin 22.11%
//   Top 5 products         Product 26, 25, 13, 15, 14
//   Customer segments      High 34 · Medium 101 · Low 40  (175 customers)
//
//  * 2018 is a partial year, so YoY vs full 2017 looks like a drop.
//    Like-for-like (Jan 1 – May 25): 32.51M vs 32.55M = -0.14 %.
// =====================================================================
